# Game Corner slot machine 0 (decomp ScrCmd_267 → overlay 101; docs/research/game-corner.md): the main stream and the
# daily random pinned, so every run seed plays the same session. Misses, a Moon Stone line with its bonus flag (the
# Poké Ball opens, Clefairy comes out: standby), a 7 line (the bonus), three bonus rounds at +14 a spin with the stops
# in Clefairy's order, the bonus end; then START. The coins come back to the field, the three rounds into
# RECORD_UNK_014, the streak of 3 over VAR_CONSECUTIVE_BONUS_ROUND_WINS (set to 2 here; a new game starts it at 9).
give item platinum:ITEM_COIN_CASE
set state coins 300
set var platinum:VAR_CONSECUTIVE_BONUS_ROUND_WINS 2
set state rng {"seed": 3}
set state gameTime.dailyRandom 1
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_GAME_CORNER 11 6 right
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
until app slots 600
until state app.prompt "bet" 3000
+0 tap bet
until state app.prompt "lever" 60
+0 tap spin
until state app.prompt "stops" 60
+0 tap stop:0
+1 tap stop:1
+1 tap stop:2
